Kadoka Quest - Provisional Licensing Notice

Copyright (c) 2026 tomiya7688

This repository is currently in a transition period while the Kadoka Quest
developer tools and the Kadoka Quest game are being separated into clearer
components. Different parts of this repository are therefore licensed under
different terms.

1. Developer Tools

Files identified as Developer Tools in LICENSE_SCOPE.md are licensed under the
MIT License. The full MIT License text is available at LICENSES/MIT.txt.

2. Kadoka Quest Game

Kadoka Quest game code, game data, game assets, story/content, and other files
not identified as Developer Tools are licensed under the provisional Kadoka
Quest Game License in LICENSES/KADOKA-GAME-PROVISIONAL.txt, unless a file or
directory contains a more specific license notice.

3. Generated Game Exception

The purpose of the Developer Tools is to let users create their own games.
Accordingly, any source code, runtime code, templates, configuration, data, or
other material that the Developer Tools intentionally generate, copy, or embed
into a generated project or generated build may be used by the recipient as
part of that generated game without royalty.

For such generated output, the recipient may use, copy, modify, merge, publish,
distribute, sublicense, and/or sell the generated game, including commercially.
A generated game may be very similar to Kadoka Quest. For example, it is
permitted for a generated game to keep substantially the same systems while
changing only characters, only maps, or other limited game content.

This exception also applies when the Developer Tools themselves have been
modified under the MIT License, provided that the relevant material was
actually emitted, copied, or embedded into the generated project or build by
the tool workflow.

4. What the Generated Game Exception Does Not Automatically Cover

The Generated Game Exception does not automatically grant permission to copy or
redistribute Kadoka Quest material that was not included in generated output.
This includes, unless actually provided as part of the generated output under
the exception, original Kadoka Quest artwork, character assets, maps, story
text, audio, logos, branding, and other game-specific content.

No trademark rights are granted by this license. Rights in third-party material
remain subject to the applicable third-party license or permission.

5. Provisional Scope During Separation

LICENSE_SCOPE.md defines the current provisional boundary between Developer
Tools and the game. Because separation is not yet complete, that list is
intentionally conservative. A file not listed there is treated under the game
license for now unless it contains its own license notice.

After the repository is reorganized, component-local license files may replace
this provisional routing. A more specific license notice in a file or directory
takes precedence over this top-level notice for that material.
